OL,3,GNEWSAScientists get funding to tackle
OL,4,A'biosecurity threat'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe University of Surrey has been
OL,7,Fawarded part of a #4m fund to develop
OL,8,Fvaccines that protect livestock.
OL,10,FIt said the funding was set to help
OL,11,F"tackle a growing biosecurity threat"
OL,12,Ffaced by the UK.
OL,14,FThe Surrey team will focus on
OL,15,Fdeveloping an mRNA vaccine for avian
OL,16,Fpathogenic E. coli, a group of bacteria
OL,17,Fwhich cause deadly infections in
OL,18,Fchickens, turkeys, ducks, and other
OL,19,Fbirds.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
