OL,3,GNEWSAScientists get funding to tackle
OL,4,A'biosecurity threat'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"E. coli in poultry poses a
OL,7,Fconsiderable threat to the global
OL,8,Fpoultry sector, which underpins
OL,9,Faffordable protein for the growing
OL,10,Fhuman population," said Dr Jai Mehat, a
OL,11,Flecturer in molecular biology.
